# MENU_PGM 2.6: Menu - Service                                                 #
#                                                                              #
# SERVICE PROGRAMS                                                             #
#   GPSSIM   > %%%%%%%% <    : Generate simulated observation data             # GPSSIM_INP
#   STA2STA  > %%%%%%%% <    : Convert station information files               # STA2STA_INP
#   STAMERGE > %%%%%%%% <    : Merge station information files                 # STAMERGE_INP
